ath=/; Domain=api.anthropic.com,]23:12:X-Robots-Tag,4:none,]29:15:cf-cache-status,7:DYNAMIC,]73:23:Content-Security-Policy,42:default-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none',]33:6:CF-RAY,20:9e8197f2bc9abe3e-DUB,]]12:http_version;8:HTTP/1.1,}7:request;3302:4:path;22:/v1/messages?beta=true,9:authority;0:,6:scheme;5:https,6:method;4:POST,4:port;3:443#4:host;17:api.anthropic.com;13:timestamp_end;18:1775486907.2060084^15:timestamp_start;18:1775486907.2052746^8:trailers;0:~7:content;2047:{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Fix Rust Compilation Error in codex-network-proxy\n\n## Context\n\nThe function `normalize_host` in `network-proxy/src/policy.rs` had its return type changed from `String` to `&str` (line 100). However, its implementation calls `normalize_dns_host()` which returns an owned `String`, making it impossible to return a borrowed `&str` ‚Äî the temporary would be dropped immediately. This single change cascades into 28 compilation errors across 4 files.\n\n## Root Cause\n\n`policy.rs:100` ‚Äî signature changed to `pub fn normalize_host(host: &str) -> &str` but the body returns `normalize_dns_host(...)` which returns `String`. Every call site that expected `String` now breaks.\n\n## Fix\n\nChange the return type of `normalize_host` back to `String` (one-line change in `policy.rs`).\n\n**File:** `codex-rs/network-proxy/src/policy.rs`, line 100\n\nChange:\n```rust\npub fn normalize_host(host: &str) -> &str {\n```\nTo:\n```rust\npub fn normalize_host(host: &str) -> String {\n```\n\nThis resolves all 28 downstream errors:\n"}]}],"system":[{"type":"text","text":"x-anthropic-billing-header: cc_version=2.1.92.45b; cc_entrypoint=cli; cch=2b7e4;"},{"type":"text","text":"You are Claude Code, Anthropic's official CLI for Claude."},{"type":"text","text":"Generate a short kebab-case name (2-4 words) that captures the main topic of this conversation. Use lowercase words separated by hyphens. Examples: \"fix-login-bug\", \"add-auth-feature\", \"refactor-api-client\", \"debug-test-failures\". Return JSON with a \"name\" field."}],"tools":[],"metadata":{"user_id":"{\"device_id\":\"af25dc708fe66d92d2ede73a106111c50d331b69b5d7deabb7c65c7cc405a0c3\",\"account_uuid\":\"\",\"session_id\":\"863760fb-348a-4472-8b41-986fb2a911d8\"}"},"max_tokens":32000,"temperature":1,"output_config":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"stream":true},7:headers;981:29:6:Accept,16:application/json,]31:13:Authorization,10:[REDACTED],]36:12:Content-Type,16:application/json,]51:10:User-Agent,33:claude-cli/2.1.92 (external, cli),]68:24:X-Claude-Code-Session-Id,36:863760fb-348a-4472-8b41-986fb2a911d8,]28:16:X-Stainless-Arch,5:arm64,]25:16:X-Stainless-Lang,2:js,]26:14:X-Stainless-OS,5:Linux,]40:27:X-Stainless-Package-Version,6:0.80.0,]31:23:X-Stainless-Retry-Count,1:0,]30:19:X-Stainless-Runtime,4:node,]41:27:X-Stainless-Runtime-Version,7:v24.3.0,]29:19:X-Stainless-Timeout,3:600,]173:14:anthropic-beta,150:interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14,redact-thinking-2026-02-12,context-management-2025-06-27,prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05,structured-outputs-2025-12-15,]52:41:anthropic-dangerous-direct-browser-access,4:true,]35:17:anthropic-version,10:2023-06-01,]26:9:x-api-key,10:[REDACTED],]14:5:x-app,3:cli,]28:10:Connection,10:keep-alive,]28:4:Host,17:api.anthropic.com,]46:15:Accept-Encoding,23:gzip, deflate, br, zstd,]25:14:Content-Length,4:2047,]]12:http_version;8:HTTP/1.1,}6:backup;0:~17:timestamp_created;18:1775486907.2054427^7:comment;0:;8:metadata;0:}6:marked;0:;9:is_replay;0:~11:intercepted;5:false!11:server_conn;4102:3:via;0:~19:timestamp_tcp_setup;18:1775486220.2908654^7:address;27:17:api.anthropic.com;3:443#]19:timestamp_tls_setup;18:1775486220.3206468^13:timestamp_end;0:~15:timestamp_start;18:1775486220.2613978^3:sni;17:api.anthropic.com;11:tls_version;7:TLSv1.3;11:cipher_list;0:]6:cipher;22:TLS_AES_256